sentences.text:
Hence, the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed in part;
ii) Compensation awarded by the Tribunal is enhanced from Rs.62,469/- to Rs.1,24,000/-
along with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. on the enhanced amount from the date of petition before Tribunal till realization;
iii) Respondent No.3-insurance company shall pay the said amount along with due interest thereon to the petitioner within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order;
vi) Draw modified award accordingly;
v) Registry to return the records to the jurisdictional Tribunal forthwith.

